  "description": "Fork of Unosquare.FFME upgraded to FFmpeg 8 with lifecycle stability work: dedicated decode/read worker threads, DirectSoundPlayer audio output, seek-to-zero close/open workaround. Native FFmpeg binaries are not included; see repository for installation notes.",
